{"nodes": [{"id": "claude_neptuno_protocol", "label": "NEPTUNO \u2014 Protocolo de ejecuci\u00f3n de alto rendimiento", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "\u00a70-\u00a79", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Las reglas se declaran no opcionales porque son el contrato de calidad del proyecto: hacen que cualquier modelo (Haiku, Sonnet, Opus) trabaje con la misma disciplina."}, {"id": "claude_ciclo_obligatorio", "label": "Ciclo ENTENDER \u2192 PLANIFICAR \u2192 EJECUTAR \u2192 VERIFICAR", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "\u00a71", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Impide saltar directamente a escribir c\u00f3digo en tareas no triviales; cada fase verifica supuestos contra el c\u00f3digo real en vez de contra la memoria del modelo."}, {"id": "claude_reglas_lectura", "label": "Reglas de lectura antes de escribir", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "\u00a72", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Alucinar la firma de una API es el fallo #1 a evitar, y la duplicaci\u00f3n de helpers es un bug de calidad; de ah\u00ed leer y buscar antes de escribir."}, {"id": "claude_grafo_orienta_no_autoriza", "label": "El grafo orienta, no autoriza", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "\u00a72", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "El subgrafo nunca es evidencia suficiente para un Edit: localiza con el grafo, despu\u00e9s lee el fragmento real."}, {"id": "claude_reglas_escritura", "label": "Reglas de escritura", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "\u00a73", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cambios m\u00ednimos que resuelven el problema completo: ni parches incompletos ni refactors no pedidos; robustez solo en los caminos que se tocan."}, {"id": "claude_honestidad_resultados", "label": "Honestidad de resultados (verificado/inferido/asumido)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "\u00a74", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Distinguir lo ejecutado y observado de lo deducido evita declarar terminado algo sin evidencia."}, {"id": "claude_economia_tokens", "label": "Econom\u00eda de tokens y contexto", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "\u00a75", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Jerarqu\u00eda de coste de 6 niveles: nunca pagar el nivel N si el N\u22121 responde; delegar b\u00fasquedas amplias para no quemar el contexto principal."}, {"id": "claude_jerarquia_coste", "label": "Jerarqu\u00eda de coste de recuperaci\u00f3n", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "\u00a75", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Orden: conversaci\u00f3n \u2192 graphify query \u2192 Grep/Glob \u2192 Read con offset \u2192 Read completo."}, {"id": "claude_autocritica", "label": "Autocr\u00edtica antes de entregar", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "\u00a76", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cuatro preguntas (\u00bfresolv\u00ed lo pedido? \u00bfqu\u00e9 entrada rompe el cambio? \u00bfdej\u00e9 algo a medias? \u00bflo aprobar\u00eda un revisor senior?) antes de reportar."}, {"id": "claude_ajuste_por_modelo", "label": "Ajuste por modelo (Haiku/Sonnet/Opus)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "\u00a77", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cada modelo tiene un modo de fallo distinto: Haiku se salta pasos, Sonnet se sobreconf\u00eda en APIs de memoria, Opus sobre-dise\u00f1a y se alarga."}, {"id": "claude_graphify_capa0", "label": "Grafo de conocimiento como capa 0 de recuperaci\u00f3n", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "\u00a78", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Las consultas sobre graphify-out/graph.json son de coste acotado y se responden desde Bash, sin coste de contexto \u2014 m\u00e1s baratas que Grep."}, {"id": "claude_graphify_query", "label": "graphify query", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "\u00a78", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "claude_graphify_explain", "label": "graphify explain", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "\u00a78", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "claude_graphify_affected", "label": "graphify affected", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "\u00a78", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Obligatorio antes de un refactor amplio: dice qu\u00e9 se rompe si tocas X."}, {"id": "claude_graphify_god_nodes", "label": "graphify god-nodes", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "\u00a78", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Los hubs arquitect\u00f3nicos son la puerta de entrada a un repo desconocido."}, {"id": "claude_skill_graphify", "label": "/graphify", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "\u00a78", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "claude_skill_context_prime", "label": "/context-prime", "file_type": "concept", "sourc